  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0024:b002:l007": "бел can denote a mountain ridge or supporting strength; support is a contextual reading in the following girding metaphor.",
    "manas-2010:p0024:b002:l022": "Белек кылдык өзүңдү literally involves making/giving a gift; holding the heir as a precious gift is provisional. Check whether this witness misreads белгиледик or a related form.",
    "manas-2010:p0025:b002:l015": "The old sorcerer is introduced on the following source line; English syntax carries across the three-line span.",
    "manas-2010:p0025:b002:l034": "Fifteen offspring of the tigers preserved as a stated epic number; not reduced or rationalized.",
    "manas-2010:p0026:b002:l003": "жолум үй is a temporary travel shelter; travel-yurt is an approximate cultural gloss for the comparison.",
    "manas-2010:p0026:b002:l005": "байлануу rendered tethered. Whether this means restrained champions or weapon-bearing readiness needs specialist review."
  }
